# UIKit Component Patterns

## Export Style

Use default exports for uikit components:

```tsx
interface ButtonProps {
  className?: string;
  children: React.ReactNode;
  disabled?: boolean;
  onClick?: () => void;
}

export default function Button({ className, children, ...props }: ButtonProps) {
  return (
    <Pressable className={cx("flex-row items-center", className)} {...props}>
      {children}
    </Pressable>
  );
}
```

## Rules

- TypeScript interface for all props
- Accept `className` prop and merge with internal classes using `cx` from `clsx`
- Use `__combinedStyles` prop on React Native primitives for react-native-css integration
- Add barrel export in `src/uikit/core/index.ts`:
  ```ts
  export { default as Button } from "./button";
  ```
- Core primitives available from `@/uikit/core`: Button, Text, View, Row, Pressable, Icon, Image, Input, Modal, ScrollView, SafeAreaView, NavigationBar, Toast, Spinner, Empty, Select, Checkbox, RadioButton, BottomSheet, FlashList, TabView, Switch, Slider, Tooltip, KeyboardAvoidingView
